CICNet's SysMon-JClient, Version 1.1

SysMon-JClient is a java based client to the System monitoring
program (sysmond).  This client polls the server daemon and reports back
the information.  

To run the program as an application:

  1: unzip or untar the distribution package.
  2: edit the JClient.sh or JClient.bat file, edit the JCLIENT variable.
     Set it to the full path name of the "SysMon-JClient-1.1.classes.zip"
	 file.  
  3: run the shell script or the batch file.
